{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/GettingStarted"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide walks through the four steps to integrate "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" into a Swidux app: add the package, configure RevenueCat, register the plugin, and attach the UI. It is the shortest path from a wired Swidux app to a working paywall. For deeper coverage of any step, follow the linked how-tos."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This package assumes you already use Swidux. If you don’t, work through Swidux’s own getting-started guide first.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Add-the-Package","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Add the Package"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" File > Add Package Dependencies, paste ","type":"text"},{"code":"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Add the products you need:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implementation and mock.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" — adds the composed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywall"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatCustomerCenter"},{"type":"text","text":" primitives (depends on RevenueCatUI)."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Package.swift:"}]}]},{"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/HeirloomLogic\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\", from: \"1.0.0\"),"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"code":[".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),",".product(name: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\", package: \"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\"),"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Configure the paywall at launch","type":"heading","anchor":"Configure-the-paywall-at-launch","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" calls into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Purchases.shared"},{"type":"text","text":" under the hood. Configure the paywall before constructing the store:"}]},{"code":["\/\/ MyApp.swift","import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","import SwiftUI","","@main","struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var store: AppStore","","    init() {","        RevenueCatPaywall.configure(apiKey: \"your_revenuecat_api_key\")","        _store = State(wrappedValue: AppStore.configured())","    }","","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup { ContentView().environment(store) }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The service itself is safe to construct before configuration. If stored-property initialization creates the store first, configure RevenueCat before dispatching paywall actions. An early read or restore throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"; an early entitlement stream finishes and can be started again after configuration. Swidux 1.9 and later clears the plugin’s observation guard when that stream ends."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"appUserID"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" (for app-group sharing with widgets), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"logLevel"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entitlementVerification"},{"type":"text","text":" (signed entitlement verification), or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"purchasesAreCompletedBy"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"storeKitVersion"},{"type":"text","text":" (app-completed purchases) if you need them — see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywall\/configure(apiKey:appUserID:userDefaults:logLevel:entitlementVerification:purchasesAreCompletedBy:storeKitVersion:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Register-the-paywall-plugin","text":"Register the paywall plugin"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"RevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in your ","type":"text"},{"code":"Store.configured()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Swidux","import SwiduxPaywall","import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","extension Store where State == AppState, Action == AppAction {","    static func configured() -> AppStore {","        let plugins = PluginHost<AppState, AppAction>()","","        plugins.register(","            PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","                state: \\.paywall,","                action: AppAction.paywall,","                extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","                service: ResilientPaywallService(","                    base: RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\"),","                    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")","                )","            )","        )","","        return Store(","            initialState: AppState(),","            reducer: AppReducer().reduce,","            plugins: plugins","        )","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ResilientPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (from SwiduxPaywall) persists the last entitlement snapshot a successful read delivered. Without it, a slow or failing network at cold launch leaves ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at its free default and gates paying users out of their features until the first successful read; with it, the last-known-good state holds until live data arrives, and the server stays authoritative — a genuine lapse is honoured on the next successful read. Wrap the RevenueCat service in it for production.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":", as shown, rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaultsKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":". The cache vouches for a paid entitlement while RevenueCat is unreachable, and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" plist is user-editable and restorable from a doctored backup; the Keychain uses OS-protected storage instead of a user-editable plist. See Swidux’s "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/securityposture"},{"type":"text","text":" for what the cache does and does not defend against."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Start the entitlement stream on the root view so the gate reflects RevenueCat’s state from launch:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        RootContent()","            .task {","                store.send(.paywall(.observeCustomerInfo))","                store.send(.paywall(.refreshCustomerInfo))","            }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Gate features by reading ","type":"text"},{"code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". See ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","type":"reference"},{"text":" for the full plugin lifecycle.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Attach-the-UI","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Attach the UI"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Attach the composed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier to a root view, driven by paywall state:"}]},{"code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","","struct RootView: View {","    @Environment(AppStore.self) private var store","","    var body: some View {","        ContentView()","            .revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter(","                state: store.paywall,","                onAction: { action in store.send(.paywall(action)) }","            )","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Trigger the paywall from a gated feature with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".paywall(.request(reason:))"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["Button(\"Export PDF\") {","    if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied {","        store.send(.export(.exportPDF))","    } else {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"export-pdf\")))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI"},{"type":"text","text":" for manual wiring with the primitive modifiers, customer-center triggering, and dismiss semantics."}]},{"anchor":"Next-Steps","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Next Steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","type":"reference"},{"text":" — Detailed walkthrough of the service lifecycle and error handling.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add a lifetime entitlement alongside the subscription."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Drive entitlement state from previews and tests."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Wire the bundled view modifiers."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior"},{"text":" — Why iOS and macOS behave differently.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — How RevenueCat entitlements map to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, configure RevenueCat, register the paywall plugin, and present the bundled sheets."}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"topic","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall","kind":"symbol","title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s "},{"code":"PaywallPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Implements "},{"code":"PaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" against ","type":"text"},{"code":"Purchases.shared","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for drop-in ","type":"text"},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" presentation.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","title":"How to Present the UI","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui","abstract":[{"text":"Attach ","type":"text"},{"code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"type":"text","text":" to a root view to present both surfaces from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallState"},{"type":"text","text":", or attach either binding-driven primitive by itself."}],"kind":"article"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywallError/notConfigured":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywallError\/notConfigured","abstract":[{"text":"RevenueCat has not been configured, so the requested operation cannot start.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notConfigured","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"RevenueCatPaywallError.notConfigured","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/revenuecatpaywallerror\/notconfigured","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/EntitlementMapping":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How RevenueCat’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo.entitlements"},{"text":" translates to Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","title":"Entitlement Mapping","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/entitlementmapping","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic"},"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/Swidux/documentation/swidux/securityposture":{"url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/securityposture","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/securityposture","title":"Security Posture","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Security Posture"}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPreviewAndTest":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive entitlement state from SwiftUI previews and tests with "},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — no RevenueCat SDK call required.","type":"text"}],"title":"How to Preview and Test","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopreviewandtest","kind":"article","role":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/PlatformBehavior":{"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/PlatformBehavior","title":"Platform Behavior","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/platformbehavior","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"How the paywall and customer-center modifiers choose presentation, and which controls remain fixed.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/RevenueCatPaywall/configure(apiKey:appUserID:userDefaults:logLevel:entitlementVerification:purchasesAreCompletedBy:storeKitVersion:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/RevenueCatPaywall\/configure(apiKey:appUserID:userDefaults:logLevel:entitlementVerification:purchasesAreCompletedBy:storeKitVersion:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configure","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"apiKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"appUserID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"userDefaults","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UserDefaults","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier"